{"id":"u-9540da99-2e5e-4f4f-8744-3ab50dcf2057","src":"community","title":"8x8 Gironda","author":"G T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/or9TA3-8x8-gironda","desc":"This program aims to rapidly build dense through extreme volume and metabolic stress, using lighter weights for 8 sets of 8 reps with 30 second rests to maximize pump, time under tension. It is an “honest workout” for aesthetics, not maximal strength. \n\nRun this 4-day split for 4-6 weeks, focusing on 3-5 exercises per session with progressive overload via weight increases every 1-2 weeks. Use 65-70% of your 8-rep max, prioritizing perfect form and constant tension—no locking out joints. Form > weight.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-07-11T09:52:57.913Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Back / Triceps","Legs","Day 3","Chest"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":9}]},{"n":"Pullover (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Single Leg Press","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Stiff Leg Deadlift","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Floor Chest Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Zottman Curl","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]},{"n":"Drag Curl","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":6,"x":8}]}]}]]}]}